<title>USA: Brightpoint completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Brightpoint completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS, Ind. 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brightpoint Inc said Wednesday it completed the previously announced acquisition of Brightpoint International Ltd. The 50 percent interest it acquired was owned by Technology Resources International Ltd.</p>
<p>The purchase price included 400,000 shares of Brightpoint common stock plus $5 million in cash.</p>
<p>John Maclean-Arnott, managing director of Brightpoint Europe, Middle East and Africa and Dana Marlin, marketing director of Brightpoint Asia Pacific, principal shareholders of Technology Resources, will continue in their capacities with Brightpoint International.</p>
<p>Brightpoint International, based in Manchester, England, is responsible for all of Brightpoint Inc's sales and marketing efforts outside of North and South America.</p>
<p>Brihgtpoint distributes wireless communication equipment.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
